# The build context is the repo root, and without this the daemon would tar up .venv
# (CPU torch, several GB), node_modules, wheelhouse, artifacts and reports before the
# first COPY ran. Admit exactly what docker/Dockerfile copies and nothing else;
# tests/boundaries/test_image_files.py keeps the two in step.
*
!cva-bundle.tar
!frontend/out
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/ledgerd-policy.json
